{
  "name": "Seal of imprisonment",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-triangle-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "",
    "description": "<p>Creates a poorly visible seal on the ground that imprisons the first target to enter it.</p><p>Once it holds a target the seal stays active on its own and no longer needs Concentration.</p><p>The seal has 4000 HP, takes half damage from Physical sources, and regenerates every fifteen minutes (90 rounds). It can also be restored for 5 HP. It is dispelled easily from the outside, for example by attacking the prisoner.</p>",
